{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T07:52:23.245Z","ordinal":10651,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_094cad5b47a7c03f016ac5fa3477e487d2baf6bdf499db12d0","status":"completed","call_id":"call_bd9786ef68da441ab401c74152422320","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/kamaz/www/strateg-projects/strateg-export-products/docs/architecture.md\\n@@\\n-The application is a Laravel 13 modular monolith. Filament 5 and Livewire 4 provide the administration interface; queued jobs execute long-running catalog workflows, while application and shared services own queue preparation, product rules, translation, and remote-shop integration. The detailed dependency rules are in [`.ai-factory/ARCHITECTURE.md`](../.ai-factory/ARCHITECTURE.md).\\n+The application is a Laravel 13 modular monolith. Filament 5 and Livewire 4 provide the administration interface; queued jobs execute long-running catalog workflows, while application and shared services own queue preparation, product rules, translation, and remote-shop integration.\\n@@\\n - Remote API jobs resolve configured shop endpoints, authenticate OpenCart-like integrations, validate responses, and persist remote IDs; Filament resources do not call shop APIs directly.\\n+- OpenCart session tokens are stored in shop options; a per-shop cache lock coordinates refresh, and a rejected operation is retried once after refresh.\\n+- A non-empty remote `error` or `warning` message is a failed response, even when the HTTP status is successful.\\n*** Update File: /home/kamaz/www/strateg-projects/strateg-export-products/.ai-factory/ARCHITECTURE.md\\n@@\\n - Responsibility:\\n   - resolve configurable remote endpoints and API base URLs\\n-  - authenticate OpenCart-like shops and refresh expired tokens\\n+  - authenticate OpenCart-like shops, reuse session tokens, and coordinate reactive refresh with a per-shop cache lock\\n   - send form-encoded export, update, backup, delete, and restore requests\\n   - persist remote IDs and external backup snapshots\\n+  - treat non-empty remote `error` and `warning` messages as failures, including on successful HTTP statuses\\n*** Update File: /home/kamaz/www/strateg-projects/strateg-export-products/.ai-factory/DESCRIPTION.md\\n@@\\n-- **Framework:** Laravel 13\\n+- **Framework:** Laravel 13\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11557-fbc9-79d0-bdea-468251dfa6dd","create_time":1791359540.4707391}}}
