tent":"REDACTED","id":"rs_094cad5b47a7c03f016ac5fa1f201887d2b81a52414bd1b244","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11557-fbc9-79d0-bdea-468251dfa6dd"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"call_id":"call_ed2182ba54b042d1b843963f4182fc6b","id":"ctc_094cad5b47a7c03f016ac5fa1f34b087d293ae361a8930d2bf","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/kamaz/www/strateg-projects/strateg-export-products/README.md\\n@@\\n | [Users](docs/user-resource.md)                                       | Administration panel users                    |\\n+| [Agent Collaboration](docs/agent-collaboration.md)                   | Delegation and Git handoff                    |\\n+| [Code Intelligence](docs/ai-code-intelligence.md)                    | Safe project-scoped code search               |\\n*** Update File: /home/kamaz/www/strateg-projects/strateg-export-products/docs/README.md\\n@@\\n | [Users](user-resource.md)                                       | Administration users                         |\\n+| [Agent Collaboration](agent-collaboration.md)                   | Delegation and Git handoff                    |\\n+| [Code Intelligence](ai-code-intelligence.md)                    | Safe project-scoped code search               |\\n*** Update File: /home/kamaz/www/strateg-projects/strateg-export-products/docs/getting-started.md\\n@@\\n-[Back to README](../README.md) · [Architecture →](architecture.md)\\n+[Back to README](../README.md) · [Architecture →](architecture.md)\\n*** Update File: /home/kamaz/www/strateg-projects/strateg-export-products/docs/architecture.md\\n@@\\n-[← Getting Started](getting-started.md) · [Back to README](../README.md) · [Configuration →](configuration.md)\\n+[← Getting Started](getting-started.md) · [Back to README](../README.md) · [Configuration →](configuration.md)\\n*** Update File: /home/kamaz/www/strateg-projects/strateg-export-products/docs/opencart-api-token-lifecycle.md\\n@@\\n-[← Remote API Integration](r