{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T07:55:47.886Z","ordinal":10711,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a1155c-872d-7ff2-be14-a3b68b6a3bd6","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"$ai-code-intelligence $ai-create-knowledge $laravel-fullstack-admin-suite Чат, создай пожалуйста `indexes`, `knowledge`, `embeddings` проекта и сохрани нужные данные в БД проекта `ai-code-intelligence`\n\nIf you have any questions, problems, doubts, or are having trouble making a decision—stop and reach out to me; I'll help you solve the problem.\n\nDon't forget about Laravel Boost, functions, methods, services, helpers, and other tools designed to simplify development and facilitate the reuse of existing functionality.\n\nUse `rg`, `Serena/LSP`, `ast-grep`, `Tree-sitter` from my PC and `PostgreSQL` (it it needs) from the `ai-code-intelligence-postgres-postgresql` dockers container for finding any code that you need.\n\nYou need to delegate the work to `AI subagents`. Use no more than 4 sub-agents! Reuse sub-agents if any are available! If there are no available agents and 4 sub-agents have already been created, then you absolutely must not create any new sub-agents! Read `docs/ai-agent-collaboration.md`."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1155c-86e8-7eb1-9147-ce9f28491fa5","create_time":1791359747.8859081,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_01a1155c-872d-7ff2-be14-a3b68b6a3bd6","turn_id":"01a1155c-86e8-7eb1-9147-ce9f28491fa5","role":"user"},"revision":"retained_01a1155c-872d-7ff2-be14-a3d64701f8aa","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":459,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"attribution_error","error_reason":"history_missing_checkpoint","sources":[{"server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"search-docs","first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c"},{"server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"applic