odel and result location:** This project uses `text-embedding-3-small` at 1536 dimensions. The persistent host path is `/home/kamaz/www/hobby/ai-code-intelligence/app/embedding-results/strateg-export-products/{year}/{month}/`, mounted in the database container at `/app/embedding-results/strateg-export-products/{year}/{month}/`. Never rely on container `/tmp` for paid results. The project guide records a completed index dated 2026-10-04: 4,343 chunks and current embeddings, 136 batches, and a project/model HNSW index. Its manifest is `strateg-export-products-full-20261004-manifest.json`. The guide says the indexed project root is `/home/kamaz/www/strateg-projects/strateg-export-products.com`, which differs from this checkout path; resolve the project row each session instead of assuming which row applies.\\n\\n**Constraints:** The embedding utility can incur API charges and prints its API key and input text to stdout; suppress stdout and keep logs private. `$POSTGRES_SIMPLE_USER` may not own the embeddings table, so index creation can require `$POSTGRES_USER`; do not combine vector inserts and owner-only index creation in one transaction. Treat retrieval as leads and verify against source. The project index has no populated symbol relations. Per the collaboration guide, delegation is capped at four subagents, only the primary agent may spawn them, subagents must not spawn others, and `git push` is reserved to the primary agent. Read-only assignments must not modify files, databases, services, Git state, or external systems.\\n\\nI did not query the database, run indexing, make embedding/API calls, or write data.\"}}\n</subagent_notification>"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1155c-86e8-7eb1-9147-ce9f28491fa5","create_time":1791359792.783977,"content_item_kinds":["multi_agent.subagent_notification"]}}}
