{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T08:21:00.370Z","ordinal":11581,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0a02b-47ee-7913-b18b-d4d4b0be8b60","turn_id":"01a11568-848a-7f52-809e-ba05365e644c","item":{"type":"CollabAgentToolCall","id":"exec-0d30e296-a548-4040-81ee-f5134f130bd5","tool":"close_agent","status":"completed","sender_thread_id":"01a0a02b-47ee-7913-b18b-d4d4b0be8b60","receiver_thread_ids":["01a1155c-acc1-7592-b303-d32b18844109"],"receiver_agents":[{"thread_id":"01a1155c-acc1-7592-b303-d32b18844109","agent_nickname":"Mendel","agent_role":"explorer"}],"agents_states":{"01a1155c-acc1-7592-b303-d32b18844109":{"completed":"The requested file `docs/ai-agent-collaboration.md` is absent; I read the matching [docs/agent-collaboration.md](/home/kamaz/www/strateg-projects/strateg-export-products/docs/agent-collaboration.md). I also read this repository’s `AGENTS.md`, the shared AI code intelligence repository’s `AGENTS.md` and `README.md`, and its agent workflow, retrieval and indexing, and architecture guides.\n\n**Safe indexing and database procedure:** Resolve the project by the slug `strateg-export-products` (or its verified root path) and use the returned UUID `project_id` for every project-scoped query or write. Check the existing files, symbols, chunks, content hashes, registered model, indexing-run state, and saved embedding results before changing anything. Exclude credentials, `.env` and local/runtime configuration, generated data, and unapproved sources. Parse a representative file before indexing the full repository; record parser failures or fallbacks accurately, and populate symbol relations only when edges were actually derived.\n\nFor an authorized refresh, update project-scoped files and extracted data, then process only changed chunks in bounded embedding batches. Save each batch and a manifest mapping result files to chunk IDs, content hashes, model, and dimensions before starting the next batch. Insert and commit vectors first; create the project/model HNSW index afterward using the table-owner role if required; verify counts and the index before marking the indexing run complete. If a step fails, inspect state and resume there, reusing saved results rather than re-embedding unchanged chunks. Avoid broad deletes or project recreation.\n\n**Configured model and result location:** This project uses `text-embedding-3-small` at 1536 dimensions. The persistent host path is `/home/kamaz/www/hobby/ai-code-intelligence/app/embedding-results/strateg-export-products/{year}/{month}/`, mounted in the database container at `/app/embedding-results/strateg-export-products/{year}/{month}/`. Never rely on container `/tmp` for paid results. The project guide records a completed index dated 2026-10-04: 4,343 chunks and current embeddings, 136 batches, and a project/model HNSW index. Its manifest is `strateg-export-products-full-20261004-manifest.json`. The guide says the indexed project root is `/home/kamaz/www/strateg-projects/strateg-export-products.com`, which differs from this checkout path; resolve the project row each session instead of assuming which row applies.\n\n**Constraints:** The embedding utility can incur API charges and prints its API key and input text to stdout; suppress stdout and keep logs private. `$POSTGRES_SIMPLE_USER` may not own the embeddings table, so index creation can require `$POSTGRES_USER`; do not combine vector inserts and owner-only index creation in one transaction. Treat retrieval as leads and verify against source. The project index has no populated symbol relations. Per the collaboration guide, delegation is capped at four subagents, only the primary agent may spawn them, subagents must not spawn others, and `git push` is reserved to the primary agent. Read-only assignments must not modify files, databases, services, Git state, or external systems.\n\nI did not query the database, run indexing, make embedding/API calls, or write data."}}},"started_at_ms":1791361260349,"completed_at_ms":1791361260370}}
