ct is not bound to selected shop` - выясни пожалуйста почему возникла эта ошибка, я просмотрел некоторые товары в админке и вижу, что товары привязаны к проекту `strateg`, возможно в админке на странице просмотра товаров загруженной очереди (`http://dev.strateg-export-products.com/opa-chirik/product-imports/product-import-batches/3`) приложение показывает ложную информацию о привязке товаров к внешним интернет магазинам","type":"input_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"mcp_attribution":{"error_reason":"history_missing_checkpoint","sources":[{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"search-docs"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"application-info"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"database-schema"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"last-error"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93a-8a22-7f32-b632-8443f368f92d","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"list_pages"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93a-8a22-7f32-b632-8443f368f92d","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"new_page"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"take_snapshot"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"fill_form"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"click"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"list_network_requests"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"navigate_page"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e946-4a81-79c0-84a8-5ef0499e81b1"