ct is not bound to selected shop` - выясни пожалуйста почему возникла эта ошибка, я просмотрел некоторые товары в админке и вижу, что товары привязаны к проекту `strateg`, возможно в админке на странице просмотра товаров загруженной очереди (`http://dev.strateg-export-products.com/opa-chirik/product-imports/product-import-batches/3`) приложение показывает ложную информацию о привязке товаров к внешним интернет магазинам","type":"input_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"mcp_attribution":{"error_reason":"history_missing_checkpoint","sources":[{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"search-docs"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"application-info"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"database-schema"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"last-error"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93a-8a22-7f32-b632-8443f368f92d","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"list_pages"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93a-8a22-7f32-b632-8443f368f92d","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"new_page"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"take_snapshot"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"fill_form"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"click"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"list_network_requests"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"navigate_page"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e946-4a81-79c0-84a8-5ef0499e81b1","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"database-query"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e966-efe7-78c2-a900-9188efc3221b","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"read-log-entries"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e9a0-e2c0-7621-92e7-b48ee0f98b0c","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"evaluate_script"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e9a0-e2c0-7621-92e7-b48ee0f98b0c","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"list_console_messages"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0ee88-d30b-7401-9c6f-2d327b12cf31","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"get-absolute-url"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0ee88-d30b-7401-9c6f-2d327b12cf31","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"wait_for"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0ee88-d30b-7401-9c6f-2d327b12cf31","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"take_screenshot"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0ee98-c23b-75a3-a749-aff413d60a30","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"fill"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0f38a-43a3-7091-861e-f34f44673992","plugin_id":"unified-computer-use@openai-bundled","server_name":"cua_repl","tool_name":"js"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0f3b8-c1ec-72d2-9474-ffc806d4d027","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"browser-logs"}],"status":"attribution_error"},"user_input_order":342},"id":"msg_01a0f83b-31a8-7cd3-9332-30e7ca8ac622","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790871024.0403674,"turn_id":"01a0f83b-301c-7943-a2cc-947ae66ea3e2"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"я привязал товары к проекту `strateg`, теперь попробуй снова выгрузить товары в проект `strateg` для этого используй `cua_repl`/`node_rep` mcp и перейди в открытую вкладку по адресу  `http://dev.strateg-export-products.com/opa-chirik/product-imports/product-import-batches`. По сути нужно сделать то же самое, запустить процесс выгрузки и тем самым по очереди проверять ajax ответы и логи текущего и внешнего проектов, если хоть 1 товар не удастся выгрузить - значит остановись, скажи мне об этом и назови причину неудачной выгрузки","type":"input_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"mcp_attribution":{"error_reason":"history_missing_checkpoint","sources":[{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"search-docs"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"application-info"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"database-schema"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"last-error"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93a-8a22-7f32-b632-8443f368f92d","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"list_pages"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93a-8a22-7f32-b632-8443f368f92d","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"new_page"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"take_snapshot"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"fill_form"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"click"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"list_network_requests"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"navigate_page"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e946-4a81-79c0-84a8-5ef0499e81b1","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"database-query"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e966-efe7-78c2-a900-9188efc3221b","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"read-log-entries"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e9a0-e2c0-7621-92e7-b48ee0f98b0c","server_name":"chrome-dev