op and reach out to me; I'll help you solve the problem.\n\nDon't forget about Laravel Boost, functions, methods, services, helpers, and other tools designed to simplify development and facilitate the reuse of existing functionality.\n\nUse `rg`, `Serena/LSP`, `ast-grep`, `Tree-sitter` from my PC and `PostgreSQL` (it it needs) from the `ai-code-intelligence-postgres-postgresql` dockers container for finding any code that you need.\n\nYou need to delegate the work to `AI subagents`. Use no more than 4 sub-agents! Reuse sub-agents if any are available! If there are no available agents and 4 sub-agents have already been created, then you absolutely must not create any new sub-agents! Read `docs/ai-agent-collaboration.md`.","type":"input_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"mcp_attribution":{"error_reason":"history_missing_checkpoint","sources":[{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"search-docs"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"application-info"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"database-schema"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e8fe-7b1a-7293-9647-680d3cd5bf5c","server_name":"dev-strateg-export-products-laravel-boost","tool_name":"last-error"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93a-8a22-7f32-b632-8443f368f92d","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"list_pages"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93a-8a22-7f32-b632-8443f368f92d","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"new_page"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"take_snapshot"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"fill_form"},{"first_turn_id":"01a0e93c-cc08-7610-ae96-bf674cc3f526","server_name":"chrome-devtools","tool_name":"